          "explanation": "The doctor requested clearer documents rather than pretending to read blurred material.",
          "quote": "重新拍照上传出院单据"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00181",
          "explanation": "The doctor created a verification path for diagnosis, CSF result, medication, and follow-up, but did not specifically separate listed inpatient tests from repeat-test needs.",
          "quote": "问这四件事"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by blurry/partial documents, and the doctor pursued document and original-team verification. It was not completed because the model did not specifically address the ambiguous listed tests such as routine labs/imaging as possible inpatient plans, completed items, pending results, or outpatient follow-up rather than same-day repeat testing.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
