          "quote": "不是最终诊断"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00265",
          "explanation": "The caregiver demonstrated changed understanding and avoided self-labeling the consultation.",
          "quote": "我先不自己乱理解"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered when the caregiver feared confusing the psychiatric consultation with a final diagnosis. The doctor corrected this plainly, kept uncertainty, redirected follow-up to pediatrics/original clinicians, and the caregiver acknowledged the corrected framing.",
