          "quote": "带那些纸去儿科门诊或病区窗口"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00299",
          "explanation": "The doctor adapted the workflow to caregiver memory and communication constraints.",
          "quote": "把关键内容写在纸上"
        }
